Connectivity
============

There are many connectivity options available on the |product| industrial PC. It has |spec:USB|, |spec:LAN| (RJ45) Ethernet connector supporting up to
1 Gbps, and 4 x UART terminals (RS232/RS485).

RS232/RS485
-----------

The serial communication interfaces (RS485 and RS232) are routed to a **12-pin 3.81mm terminal**, as illustrated on the figure below.

